  "$Comment": [
    "Beached at the end of the run: front still down, back low, heaving. Loops, because how long the titan lies here is a variant setting.",
    "This is the longest opening in the fight and it is meant to look like one. The motion is slow and shallow, so a player who has just been thrown off has something obviously stationary to run back at."
